      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;there-never-was-anything-other-than-that-jean-pierre-gomez&#34;&gt;There never was anything other than That Jean-Pierre Gomez&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/no_me_gomez.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Jean-Pierre Gomez&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/who_are_you.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/who_are_you.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.you-are-that.com/&#34;&gt;Jean-Pierre&amp;rsquo;s website&lt;/a&gt; where each of the dialogues from the book may be read on-line or downloaded.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Link to entry on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/teachers/teachersa_g.htm#gomez&#34;&gt;Current Teacher&amp;rsquo;s page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To download a PDF file of the complete book visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.theeternalstate.org/&#34;&gt;Charlie Hayes&amp;rsquo; site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Q &lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; Hi Jean-Pierre, you mentioned that searching is a trap. Thank you for being there to guide people like me out of a lifelong habit of searching. I am apparently still trapped though, as questions still arise.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
